{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想把家庭合照、寵物或人像變成可以親手完成的數字油畫，Paint By Number Creator 能把相片轉換成帶編號的經典畫作，既可自己慢慢填色，也能列印成手作禮物送人。應用原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂色數與紙張尺寸</h2>\n<p>開啟相片後，可選擇 Rough 快速產生粗略色塊，或切換 Precise 精細描繪輪廓，編號區域隨即浮現。色盤支援 2 至 64 種顏色，並可對應 A4、A3 或 A2 紙張。完成後可數碼填色，一次填滿整幅或逐區點按，也能匯出附色鍵的 PDF，方便以真實顏料與畫紙作畫。顏色標示兼容 RAL、RGB、HEX 與 Pantone FHI，作品會存入圖庫隨時續畫。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-81-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-82-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-83-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-84-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-85-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-86-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Paint By Number Creator</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T17:19:29.229615+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":362,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}